{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca0 Cyber Shard Clicker </strong>is a short incremental game. Break down geometric shapes representing hostile cyber attacks against Vault Inc., gather data shards, upgrade your hacking skills, and spend your data shards to unlock permanent boosts in the vast skill tree to push your cyber assault even further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hack, Upgrade, Dominate: The Grid Awaits in Cyber Shard Clicker</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u26a1Cyber beats and glitch effects to set the mood for your digital assault</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644260/extras/7529042b80ce0cecd9b805bd134b2bdb.poster.avif?t=1762972295\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644260/extras/7529042b80ce0cecd9b805bd134b2bdb.webm?t=1762972295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Skill Tree</strong> \u2013 Invest in permanent boosts and abilities, reshaping your strategy for faster infiltration and stronger attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644260/extras/3fc7d8564cfd8351a3bd5bbe4f699bf8.poster.avif?t=1762972295\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644260/extras/3fc7d8564cfd8351a3bd5bbe4f699bf8.webm?t=1762972295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644260/extras/3fc7d8564cfd8351a3bd5bbe4f699bf8.mp4?t=1762972295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u26a1 Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbb <strong>A Cyberpunk Incremental Hacker Experience</strong> \u2013 Destroy geometric shapes representing Vault Inc.\u2019s security systems and collect valuable data shards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Immersive Neon Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 Stylish retro-futuristic visuals with a dark hacker vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Satisfying Progression System</strong> \u2013 Unlock upgrades, enhance your clicker efficiency, and push your hacking to new heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Skill Tree</strong> \u2013 Invest in permanent boosts and abilities, reshaping your strategy for faster infiltration and stronger attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Strategic Choices</strong> \u2013 Balance your resources between immediate upgrades and long-term permanent improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce1 <strong>Endless Replayability</strong> \u2013 Every run offers deeper infiltration and tougher corporate defenses to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Atmospheric Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Cyber beats and glitch effects to set the mood for your digital assault. <br> <br> <br>\ud83d\ude4f Thank you so much for checking out <strong>Cyber Shard Clicker</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m a solo indie game developer, and I\u2019m constantly improving the game based on community feedback. By purchasing and playing, you\u2019re supporting my journey to keep creating better and more engaging experiences. Best wishes, and see you in the grid!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name"